  "body": "If you are looking for a solid family home in Campbells Bay, this one is very easy to understand.\r\n\r\nSet on a 902m² freehold section, this home offers 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, generous parking and flexible living for a growing family or extended family. The downstairs guest suite with its own ensuite is ideal for parents, teenagers, guests or family members who want their own private space.\r\n\r\nThe location is one of the strongest parts of this property. You are only a short stroll to Campbells Bay Beach, with the coastal lifestyle right on your doorstep. Morning walks, weekend swimming, children playing by the beach, or simply enjoying one of the North Shore’s most established seaside communities — this is the lifestyle many families are looking for.\r\n\r\nThe school zones are also excellent and very clear:\r\nPrimary:          Campbells Bay School\r\nIntermediate: Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\nCollege/High School: Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School\r\n\r\nFor daily life, everything is close by. Milford shops, cafes and supermarket are only a short drive away. Albany shopping centre, Massey University and motorway access are also within easy driving distance. Takapuna and the North Shore business areas are convenient too, making this a very practical location for families.\r\n\r\nThe home itself has been nicely updated, with polished timber floors, a bright open-plan kitchen and dining area, underfloor heating in tiled areas, and good indoor-outdoor flow. The front and back yards are both usable, giving children and pets space to play, with room for outdoor entertaining, gardening, or future improvement.\r\n\r\nA full 902m² freehold site in Campbells Bay, close to the beach and zoned for top schools, is not something you can easily replace.\r\n\r\nThis is a home for families who want land, location, school zones and long-term value.",
